  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with this inspiring personalized blanket from Jeminise. Designed for Christian women, this unique blanket combines uplifting messages with soft warmth, making it a perfect keepsake or a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect personalized gift combining faith, love, and comfort, ideal for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Easily customize by selecting your preferred design and adding a custom name or text.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for various uses.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Christian Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes for daily encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones as a spiritual gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made with polyester fabric, offering a lightweight and comfortable experience.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
